{"id":"n14752-1-10","stage":1,"title":"갈색 · 褐色","scene":"失物寻找","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14752-1-10-1","ko":"여기 있던 갈색 가죽 지갑 못 봤어요?","zh":"请问有没有看到原来放在这里的棕色皮夹？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}},{"text":"있던","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있던","audio":"/audio/abc85abdfa55b1e0bc82.mp3"}},{"text":"갈색","meaning":"褐色","explanation":"갈색：褐色。","readings":[{"term":"갈색","audio":"/audio/6c353afe7f9ea283c859.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14752","senseId":"1","lemma":"갈색","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갈색","audio":"/audio/6c353afe7f9ea283c859.mp3"}},{"text":"가죽","meaning":"皮，皮制","explanation":"가죽：皮，皮制。","readings":[{"term":"가죽","audio":"/audio/cf8ce1f947bf1cff4b70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59915","senseId":"2","lemma":"가죽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가죽","audio":"/audio/cf8ce1f947bf1cff4b70.mp3"}},{"text":"지갑","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"没、没有","explanation":"못 与 봤어요 合用，问对方是否没看到那只皮夹；这里不强调视力或能力。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"봤어요?","meaning":"看到了吗","explanation":"보다：用眼睛看见；-았- 表示过去，-어요? 是礼貌问句。못 봤어요? 即“没看到吗？”","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봤어요","audio":"/audio/c0a52b735e5a5e2481b8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6c353afe7f9ea283","term":"갈색","zh":"褐色","audio":"/audio/6c353afe7f9ea283c859.mp3","entryId":"14752","definition":"像干枯的树叶一样的暗黄色。","pronunciation":["갈쌕"]},{"id":"cf8ce1f947bf1cff","term":"가죽","zh":"皮，皮制","audio":"/audio/cf8ce1f947bf1cff4b70.mp3","entryId":"59915","definition":"把动物身上剥下来的表皮进行加工后的东西。","pronunciation":["가죽"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"没、未能","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"放在动词前表示动作未实现；这里是询问是否看见皮夹。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/59047ed1e5e375b111a7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14752-1-10-2","ko":"방금 어떤 사람이 가져갔어요.","zh":"刚才有人拿走了它。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才。","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个。","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"사람이","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"가져갔어요.","meaning":"带走，拿走","explanation":"가져가다：带走，拿走；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가져가다","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53811","senseId":"1","lemma":"가져가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가져갔어요","audio":"/audio/c1ef33ba62d1b532cdad.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"d96cfec150bdc38f","term":"가져가다","zh":"带走，拿走","audio":"/audio/d96cfec150bdc38f4c11.mp3","entryId":"53811","definition":"把某个东西从一个地方搬去另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가저가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/11b722aa29fa58512d1f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.947,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14752","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"se